  "content_md": "Yeah seems like \"blig\" https://youglish.com/pronounce/blyg/swedish\n\n![[4fha1agvrskdaxmzmnjd5vr3xh]]\n\n",
  "content_html": "<p>Yeah seems like &quot;blig&quot; <a href=\"https://youglish.com/pronounce/blyg/swedish\">https://youglish.com/pronounce/blyg/swedish</a></p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"4fha1agvrskdaxmzmnjd5vr3xh\" data-blyg-version=\"1\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://venkateshrao.com/blyg/\">\n<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"11dhmv36d1btjba16ez594nk00\" data-blyg-version=\"1\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://blyg.aneeshsathe.com/\">\n<p>How is everyone pronouncing ‘Blyg’?</p>\n<p>I’m going ‘Bligh’ but I suppose ‘Bliegh’ is an alternative?</p>\n<p>Whatever we name the collective Blygs the people will be Blyggeratti</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n<p>I don’t know how the Swedish word is pronounced but I’m going with blig</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n",
